            "content": "No, I haven't hurt myself. It's just a thought. I know I need to talk to someone about it, but it feels like a failure to admit it."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "I see, thank you for tellling me. It must be hard for you, but i want you to know that this is a safe place, i really want to help and understand what you're been feeling. im curious, since when have you felt this way?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "It started about six months ago. I moved to a new city and just... felt disconnected. I thought it would get better, but it hasn’t really."
